Z||000001||Songman||08-12-2001||07:40 PM||||Hey Randy...<P>Congrats on the new Fiero. Hope the rest of us TN boys and girls get to see it next month at the RFTH.<P>Here's what I got from Carfax on your Fiero...<P>It says that it was stolen and used in a drug deal and then confiscated by DEA agents. But the DEA agents were on the take so it was used in several drive-bys on crack houses of rival gangs.<P>Other than that, it actually started life as a 1968 Nova and was later converted by putting the engine in the trunk and plastic body panels are duct taped to the four corners.<P>The last known title was in the name of Saddam Hussein and other than sand damage the car should be fine...<P>Oh wait! I messed up! I ran the number through CarFiction instead of CarFax! Oh well... Can't wait to see your car, buddy! Good luck with the updates!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||12
